# The frappe / ERPNext / HRMS / CRM release tags production runs — the ONE source for the image
# build (release-image.yml → Dockerfile build args) and for CI's reused test benches
# (_app-tests.yml), so tests run on exactly what ships. Bump deliberately, together.
# HRMS (Frappe HR) is baked in for every store; a store gets it only when its site runs
# `bench install-app hrms` (attendance, shifts, leave).
# CRM (Frappe CRM) is baked in AND installed on every site: ffl_core requires it (ffl_core.crm).
# A new site gets it with ffl_core; an existing one on its first deploy (deploy/prod/auto_deploy.sh).
FRAPPE_REF=v16.52.0
ERPNEXT_REF=v16.51.1
HRMS_REF=v16.52.0
CRM_REF=v16.0.1
